# Keep the build context small, and keep local secrets out of the image.
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.venv
venv

# Every .env variant — backend/.env holds a real API key, and the image takes its
# settings from the environment App Runner injects instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
frontend/dist

# backend/static is deliberately absent from this list. The Dockerfile overwrites it
# from the Vite stage, so excluding it would cost nothing here — but App Runner's
# revised build is also a Docker build over this same context, and there the committed
# bundle is the only frontend there is. Ignoring it strips the site out of the image
# and leaves FastAPI answering / with a 404.

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.tsbuildinfo

docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
README.md
